<<<
factious,factitious, fictitious. Though
===
**factious,factitious,fictitious.** Though
>>>

<<<
Thus factious rancour is the rancour that lets party spirit prevail over patriotism; factitious rancour is a rancour that is not of natural growth, but has been deliberately created to serve someone’s ends; & fictitious rancour is a rancour represented as existing but imaginary.
===
Thus *factious rancour* is the rancour that lets party spirit prevail over patriotism; *factitious rancour* is a rancour that is not of natural growth, but has been deliberately created to serve someone’s ends; & *fictitious rancour* is a rancour represented as existing but imaginary.
>>>

<<<
